1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
The AI pilot worked.

2
00:00:01,790 --> 00:00:02,810
The rollout failed.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,870
This is the most common story in

4
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,280
enterprise GTM right now.

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,090
A small team runs a pilot.

6
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:09,720
The results are promising.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,050
Leadership approves a broader rollout.

8
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,060
Six months later, adoption is low, the

9
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,150
results have not replicated, and the

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,170
initiative is quietly deprioritized.

11
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,790
The failure is almost never about the

12
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:22,430
technology.

13
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,050
It is about the conditions that made the

14
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,590
pilot work not being present at scale.

15
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:31,030
In the pilot, a champion drove adoption.

16
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,490
In the rollout, adoption was optional.

17
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:36,560
In the pilot, the data was clean because

18
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:37,500
someone prepared it.

19
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,860
In the rollout, the data was whatever

20
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,160
was already in the CRM.

21
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,920
In the pilot, success was measured

22
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,450
clearly.

23
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,660
In the rollout, no one agreed on what

24
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,610
success looked like.

25
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:50,070
Scaling AI requires replicating the

26
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,610
conditions of the pilot, not just the

27
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,060
tool.

28
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,370
That means defined ownership, clean

29
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:58,200
data, clear metrics, and leadership

30
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:00,030
accountability at every level of the

31
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:00,490
rollout.

32
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:02,560
The technology is the easy part.

33
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,660
The operating model is where most teams

34
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:04,990
fail.

35
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,050
Follow A-Gent for the agent-first GTM

36
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:08,540
playbook.
